CLASS com/xk72/proxy/ssl/class_1403 com/xk72/proxy/ssl/MaybeClientCertificateProvider
	COMMENT [inferred] how SSLContextFactory asks the Charles side whether a client certificate
	COMMENT applies to an upstream host, keeping the proxy library free of Charles' configuration
	COMMENT model. Charles 4 had it as the unnamed com.xk72.proxy.ssl.g.
	METHOD method_2591 hasClientCertificate (Ljava/lang/String;I)Z
		ARG 1 host
		ARG 2 port
	METHOD method_2592 addClientCertificates (Ljava/lang/String;ILjava/security/KeyStore;[C)V
		COMMENT called only when hasClientCertificate said yes; the implementation adds entries to the
		COMMENT key store the caller is about to build a KeyManagerFactory from.
		ARG 1 host
		ARG 2 port
		ARG 3 keyStore
		ARG 4 password
